    "Nobody there matched. Try the other directories." : "Alí non coincidiu ninguén. Probe nos outros directorios.",
    "Nobody in these directories matched. To find somebody who is not listed, put their full handle, like @someone@example.org or @someone.example.com, into the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Non coincidiu ninguén nestes directorios. Para atopar a alguén que non aparece, escriba o seu identificador completo, como @alguen@example.org ou @alguen.example.com, na busca da parte superior da barra lateral.",
