    "Nothing is failing to deliver." : "Non hai ningunha entrega fallando.",
    "(only the first few hundred were counted)" : "(só se contaron os primeiros centos)",
    "A delivery is abandoned after {attempts} attempts." : "Unha entrega abandónase após {attempts} intentos.",
    "The longest-failing one was last tried {ago}." : "A que leva máis tempo fallando intentouse por última vez {ago}.",
